00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.490
Ah! You're here too, Momo!

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:20.200
Onee-sama...

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.870
Lala, right now we're...

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.280
