00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:23.180
It looks like this Change-kun has a system to automatically revert the body exchange after a time limit.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:27.180
So that means we have to wait seven hours to return to our own bodies?!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.890
By that time, it'll be evening!

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.690
