00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.610
Why don't we call big sister back and ask her about it?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:47.870
But...

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.200
Right?

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.920
Just before, Lala was so relieved that nothing bad had happened...

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.460
It's kind of hard to say to her after that.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:03.800
I think I can bear with it until this evening, at least.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.600
What about you, Yuuki-kun?

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.260
