00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:47.140
Sairenji Haruna.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:51.100
That way of falling was just like Yuuki Rito.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.730
If you were Yuuki Rito, I'd be chopping you up right now.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.610
