Huh?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.610
Yuuki-kun?

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.030
Um... Are you okay?

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.530
I'll escort you to the infirmary.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:01.240
Thank you... Please do.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.500
Do you have a cold or something?

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.000
I don't think that's what it is.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.010
Oh?

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.010
That device is working?

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.520
Sensei?!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.440
Ah!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.210
No!

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.520
No...!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.790
Watch out!

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:54.980
Yuuki Rito.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.780
What are you doing to Tear?

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:05.410
Yami?!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:10.700
I thought I heard Rito-san's voice somewhere over here...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.450
Hm?

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.290
T-Tearju-sensei?!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.460
I'm sorry, Sensei..

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:21.800
It looks like one of my inventions caused you trouble.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.880
So, what is that thing, anyway?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.130
Oh, this?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.470
It's a device that allows you to give yourself a massage!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:32.520
I thought I'd give this to Honekawa-sensei as a present,

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.680
because he has back pain.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:36.850
I'm happy.

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:38.980
I'm so happy!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.280
From now on, you have to be more careful.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.160
By the way, Tearju-sensei.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.280
Do you know where Rito-san is?

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.040
He was with me just before, but...

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:59.000
Please die.

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:04.010
It's a misunderstanding!

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:05.800
I didn't mean to, I'm sorry! {etc, etc}
